sequenceDiagram
  participant P as CMP-005 Policy
  participant G as CMP-006 Privilege Gateway
  participant A as Qualified Actuator
  participant O as CMP-003 Observer
  participant S as CMP-008 Store
  P->>G: typed CandidateAction
  G->>G: verify exact profile + qualification + exclusions
  alt not qualified / unsafe / uncertain
    G-->>P: REJECT / NO_OP
  else qualified
    G->>G: capture SafetySnapshot + journal
    G->>A: apply bounded operation
    A-->>G: read-back
    G->>O: canary observation
    alt postcondition and health pass
      G->>S: outcome evidence
      G-->>P: VERIFIED_SUCCESS
    else failure / controller fight / regression
      G->>A: rollback
      A-->>G: rollback read-back
      G->>S: failure + suspension evidence
      G-->>P: ROLLED_BACK / CRITICAL_FAULT if unresolved
    end
  end
